  "subject": {
    "id": "grounded-pack-public-guidance-and-small-shop-evidence",
    "type": "DOCUMENT"
  },
  "summary": "Bind the public pack guidance and current Small Shop replay evidence.",
  "why": "The public reference now exposes only the narrow pack-grounding and pack-conformance checkers beside the compiler facade. Current Small Shop evidence is regenerated under the advanced compiler profile, while the original RET-010 receipt remains immutable and separately guarded. Exact governance tests now describe the current public adapter boundary and bind all five compiler-profile files that evolved after the original LinkML research candidate. This keeps current reproducibility distinct from historical evidence instead of rewriting one as the other."
}
